mode: "100644"
header: "---\nname: pinterest-growth\ndescription: >-\n  The Pinterest growth playbook for 2026. Use when someone wants to \"grow on Pinterest,\" \"get traffic\n  from Pinterest,\" \"a Pinterest strategy,\" a pin cadence/board structure, or to turn blog/product\n  content into pins. Pinterest is a visual SEARCH engine where keyword-optimized, fresh, vertical\n  pins compound into evergreen outbound traffic — optimise for discoverability + clicks, not\n  in-the-moment engagement. Uses the PINS framework. Reads brand-profile + voice-builder first. The\n  agent drafts pins + the schedule; WoopSocial schedules/publishes pins; metrics come from native\n  Pinterest Analytics; nothing is fabricated. For \"Pinterest SEO\" / \"rank my pins\" / keyword\n  titles-descriptions route to pinterest-seo; for designing the pin image route to\n  pinterest-pin-design. Pairs with content-recycling.\nversion: 1.0.0\nprompt-source: prompt.toon\n---\n"
